atus":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Split from rollup #1294 (TODO.md backlog), triage task 2544, judged at main HEAD e561ab58.\n\n## Already done (do not redo)\nCursor opacity fading/strobing/hover are implemented in `pkgs/id/web/src/cursors.ts` (fade 30s→60s minimum→5m hidden, strobe slows with fade, hover = 100% opacity + top z-index; the TODO file's own \"Done?\" list matches).\n\n## Remaining scope\n- Tooltip visibility modes: full / minimal / hidden toggle in the UI (minimal = cursor only, tooltip on hover ≥1s; hidden = tracked but not shown, pinned cursors exempt).\n- Click-to-enlarge tooltip with the 1s revert chain (big → tooltip → minimal), per-cursor minimize/restore lists for full and minimal modes, and pin/unpin on the big tooltip.\n- Client + server logging of cursor lifecycle (first inactive, minimum reached, removed, hover/unhover).\n- Verify inactivity is based on connection liveness (websocket pong/activity), not pointer idleness — a connected client's cursor stays visible.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- The modes, pin/unpin, and minimize/restore behaviours above work in the web UI with tests at the existing `web/src/*.test.ts` pattern level.\n- Lifecycle log lines exist client- and server-side; the liveness basis for inactivity is verified and documented in the PR.\n","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/s